flowchart LR
  YAML[配置 / ConfigLoader] --> Registry[HealthRegistry]
  Input[ROS 原始消息 / 其他节点输出] --> Adapter[IInputAdapter / 类型和单位适配]
  Adapter --> Checker[IHealthChecker / 雷达 IMU 定位及扩展]
  Registry --> Adapter
  Registry --> Checker
  Runtime[独立 RuntimeController] --> Lifecycle[LifecycleTracker / 意图 实例 epoch]
  Lifecycle --> Checker
  Shared[StreamTracker / Kinematics / Covariance / IClock] --> Checker
  Checker --> Latch[RuleLatch / 周期最严重事件]
  Latch --> Aggregate[DependencyAggregator / 等级与业务有效性]
  Aggregate --> Output[DiagnosticPublisher / 通用 HealthPanel]
  Latch --> Log[EventRecorder / 可追溯日志]
  Lifecycle --> Log
  YAML --> Log
